<title>USA: Wave Tech sees strong revenue growth.</title>
<headline>Wave Tech sees strong revenue growth.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wave Technologies International Inc said Wednesday it expects strong revenue growth in all business segments throughout the remainder of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company posted July 31 first-quarter earnings of $0.06 per share on revenues of $6.7 million, compared to a year-earlier loss of $0.13 per share on revenues of $5.9 million.</p>
<p>President Kenneth Kousky said the company will benefit from a fall schedule with the addition of evening and weekend classes throughout its U.S. training centers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
